    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Help Wanted</strong> - Eggnog Inspector</h2><br>Would you like to earn a fabulous income? Do you want to spend all day testing eggnog? One of these two things is entirely achievable at Imperial Eggnog, part of the Eggnog Incorporated family.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Company</strong></h2><br>Imperial Eggnog has been creating the world's finest* eggnog since the 13th century. Our eggnog has been voted superior to N\u00f6g's eggnog 650 years in a row**<br><br>What we lack in aesthetics, we make up for with charisma, honor, dignity, respect, appeal, trust, wisdom, intelligence, stamina, luck, strength, agility, reputation, and good old-fashioned fun.<br><br><i>*As rated internally by Imperial Eggnog employees<br>**Not necessarily true</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Position</strong></h2><br>As Eggnog Inspector you will be the last line of defense. Your duties will include :<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Check Eggnog packaging<br></li><li>Obedience<br></li><li>Check Eggnog color<br></li><li>Smell nice<br></li><li>Check Eggnog ingredients<br></li><li>Do <strong>NOT</strong> accept any form of communication from rival company &quot;Nog&quot;<br></li><li>...and more!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>To Apply - Fill out the application form within.</strong></h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461360/extras/e23d1fbfa5d9eeb3a8de2d5f53abc3b0.webp?t=1743678011\" /></div><br>-Imperial Eggnog HR",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Help Wanted</strong> - Eggnog Inspector</h2><br>Would you like to earn a fabulous income? Do you want to spend all day testing eggnog? One of these two things is entirely achievable at Imperial Eggnog, part of the Eggnog Incorporated family.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Company</strong></h2><br>Imperial Eggnog has been creating the world's finest* eggnog since the 13th century. Our eggnog has been voted superior to N\u00f6g's eggnog 650 years in a row**<br><br>What we lack in aesthetics, we make up for with charisma, honor, dignity, respect, appeal, trust, wisdom, intelligence, stamina, luck, strength, agility, reputation, and good old-fashioned fun.<br><br><i>*As rated internally by Imperial Eggnog employees<br>**Not necessarily true</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Position</strong></h2><br>As Eggnog Inspector you will be the last line of defense. Your duties will include :<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Check Eggnog packaging<br></li><li>Obedience<br></li><li>Check Eggnog color<br></li><li>Smell nice<br></li><li>Check Eggnog ingredients<br></li><li>Do <strong>NOT</strong> accept any form of communication from rival company &quot;Nog&quot;<br></li><li>...and more!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>To Apply - Fill out the application form within.</strong></h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461360/extras/e23d1fbfa5d9eeb3a8de2d5f53abc3b0.webp?t=1743678011\" /></div><br>-Imperial Eggnog HR",
    "short_description": "Enjoy working as an Eggnog Inspector for a shady company. Verify the color, art, ingredients for batches of eggnog. Its not glamorous but its an honest living. Who knows what surprises are in store for you...",
